  "a_sister_s_all_you_need": {
    "anilist_id": 98596,
    "synopsis": "The story follows the everyday life of Itsuki, a novelist and \"modern day Pygmalion\" who works day in and day out to create the ultimate younger sister. He's surrounded by various other characters: a beautiful genius writer who loves him, his big-sisterly classmate from college, a fellow male writer, a sadistic tax accountant, and his editor. They're all looked after by Itsuki's perfect younger step-brother, Chihiro, who has a serious secret.<br> <br> (Source: Anime News Network)<br> <br> <i>Note: The first episode received an early screening at a special event held at Shinjuku Piccadilly, Tokyo on 06.09.2017.</i>",
