  "aesthetica_of_a_rogue_hero": {
    "anilist_id": 13161,
    "synopsis": "Hero defeats bad guy. Good triumphs over evil. The end. Or, at least that's how it usually goes. But what happens after the hero goes home? Our hero, Akatsuki Ousawa, is about to find out that sometimes the greatest adventure starts once happily ever after ends.<br><br> (Source: FUNimation)",
