  "azumanga_daioh": {
    "anilist_id": 66,
    "synopsis": "Ten year old child prodigy, Chiyo Mihama, is finding it tough fitting in at high school with the girls five years her elder: Osaka (dimwitted with a weird take on the world), Tomo (a powder keg that goes off at a moment’s notice), Kagura (the competitive athlete of the bunch), Yomi (the hothead), and Sakaki (timid and obsessed with a love of animals that isn’t reciprocated). Together with their teacher, they navigate the rough waters and fun times of high school.<br> <br> (Source: Sentai Filmworks)",
    "image_url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx66-ZqYQWl6LsfeI.png",
