    "synopsis": "A heroic and mighty adventurer dreams of...opening a pharmacy?<br> <br> Red was once a part of the Hero’s party, a group destined to save the world by fighting the Raging Demon Lord. But after being betrayed by his comrade, Red hopes to start anew by opening a small apothecary in a sleepy town on the frontier. While keeping his past life a secret is the goal, it won’t be easy...especially when a beautiful adventurer from his past asks to move in.<br> <br> (Source: Funimation)",
