  },
  "black_lagoon_the_second_barrage": {
    "anilist_id": 1519,
    "synopsis": "Okajima Rokuro - now known almost exclusively as 'Rock' - was once a typical, put-upon Japanese businessman. Then, on a routine business trip, he was kidnapped and ransomed by the Lagoon Company: a band of mercenary pirates operating out of the crime-riddled city of Roanapur. Abandoned by his bosses, he joined the Lagoon Company. Now he must try and stay afloat amongst the ever-shifting politics of the criminal underworld, while simultaneously avoiding death at the hands of his quick-tempered, gun-toting co-worker, 'Two Hand' Revy. <br><br> (Source: Anime News Network)",
    "image_url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx1519-cScqJxQW3LNL.png",
